    <string name="feature_settings_about_text">A local music player. Free, no ads, no account. Made in Belém, Brazil, with AI assistance under the author’s direction and review.</string>
    <string name="feature_settings_privacy_text">Your library, your settings and your listening stats stay on your device only. The app has no account, no ads and sends nothing about you anywhere.\n\nWhen the artist page and release radar arrive, the app will query Deezer and Last.fm only to fetch public information about artists and albums. Scrobbling to Last.fm only happens if you turn it on.\n\n“Check for updates” only contacts GitHub when you tap it.\n\nThe only permission requested is music and audio, to read the songs on your phone. The app doesn’t ask for photos, videos, contacts or location.</string>
